        {
            "block_label": "vision_footnote",
            "block_content": "Although including \"keyPurposeId\" (as part of \"ExtendedKeyUsage\") is mentioned as optional, it is highly recommended to include this parameter in the SECC certificate. This makes the certificate more secure and prevents its misuse.",
